  <!-- Merged from RimUtinni/FactionSlate (mandrake.rut.patches, MOD_CONSOLIDATION_SPRINT_1):
       Patches/FactionSlate/OnlyOurFactions.xml zeroes startingCountAtWorldCreation on 48
       FactionDefs so only the campaign's own factions offer on the Configure Factions page.
       It is PatchOperationConditional with no <nomatch>, so a faction whose owning mod has
       not loaded YET is a silent no-op — this forceLoadAfter list (built from the live def
       dump's per-def packageId attribution, JAWA_FACTION_SLATE_LOAD_ORDER_1) is the fix, and
       is REQUIRED, not optional, for the patch to do its whole job. -->
